{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"submission\":\"update.json\",\"summary\":\"Requested execution that converts the former-voter ReadIndex quorum refutation from a source trace into a measurement. The harness queues one follower read at a leader with voters {1,2,3}, then delivers the same confirming heartbeat response from node 4, which is in no role map, once through the Peer admission path and once directly at the raft state machine, and finally from voter 3. Local construction runs showed the pending request unchanged in both unknown-sender deliveries and confirmed by the voter's response with one reply addressed to the requester. The harness was moved under internal/raft so the primary harness path is unambiguous. Validation reports valid with execution_requested and one experiment create; recording the resulting fact and updated interpretation awaits the receipt.\"}"}}
